    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Brady O'Flaherty are delighted to introduce No. 22 Easton Mews to the market. This beautiful contemporary three-bedroom semi-detached home must be viewed to be truly appreciated.\n\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation extending to 134 sq m, across three floors. \n\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, spacious living room, contemporary kitchen/dining area and guest W.C./utility room at ground floor level. On the first floor there are two generous bedrooms, a home office and a large family bathroom featuring both a separate bath and walk-in shower. The converted attic provides excellent additional accommodation and benefits from its own en-suite bathroom, offering a versatile space suitable for a variety of uses.\n\n\nOutside, the property enjoys private landscaped rear gardens. To the front, there is off-street parking on a private driveway together with a convenient side passage providing access to the rear garden.\n\n\nEaston Mews is a well-established residential development, offering the perfect blend of suburban convenience and commuter accessibility. Residents enjoy easy access to an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools, neighbourhood shops, cafés, restaurants and sporting facilities. Leixlip Village, with its wide range of amenities, is just a short distance away, while both Confey and Leixlip Louisa Bridge train stations are within easy reach, providing regular services to Dublin City Centre. The area is further enhanced by excellent road connectivity via the M4 and M50.\n\n\nAll in all, this is an ideal home for first-time buyers, young families or indeed those seeking to downsize to a most convenient and desirable location. Combining spacious accommodation, excellent presentation and a prime position, No. 22 Easton Mews represents a superb opportunity to acquire a quality home in an established residential setting.\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nKitchen - 5.25 x 4.50m\nBright and modern kitchen cabintery with solid wood counter tops. Tiled flooring. Double patio doors to rear garden.\n\nEntrance Hall - 5.14 x 2.41m\nWelcoming entrance hall with high quality laminate flooring. Recessed lighting. Alarm panel. Understairs storage solution.\n\nLiving Room - 5.85 x 3.18m\nLarge living room to the front of the house with front and side window. Feature inset electric fireplace. High quality laminate flooring.\n\nWC / Utility - 2.28 x 1.14m\nWC. WHB. Washing machine. Countertop.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.00 x 3.12m\nLarge double bedroom to rear of property with large fitted wardrobes. Carpet flooring. Window Blinds.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.17 x 3.12m\nDouble bedroom to front of property. Fitted wardrobes. Carpet flooring. Window blinds.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.60 x 1.85m\nTo front of property. Ideally suit use as home office / nursery. Carpet floor. Window blind.\n\nAttic - 4.92x 4.29m\nLarge room with ample storage and en-suite. Laminate flooring. 2 roof windows.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.15 x 1.08m\nFully tiled. Corner shower. WHB. WC. Roof window.\n\nBathroom - 3.06 x 2.03m\nLarge family bathroom. Fully tiled. Bathtub. Saperate walk-in shower. Heated towel rail. LED wall mounted mirror. Window.\n\nOutside - \nTo the front, there is a driveway providing off-street parking for one car with lawn to side. Gated side entrance. To the rear, there is a paved patio and lawn area. Small garden shed providing useful outdoor storage.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>134 sq m </li><li>3 bed with attic conversion</li><li>Attractive brick front elevation </li><li>GFCH</li><li>South facing aspect</li><li>Tastefully decorated & well maintained throughout</li><li>Close to all the amenities Leixlip has to offer inc Louisa Bridge Rail Station</li><li>Flooring, blinds, light fittings & kitchen appliances included in sale</ul>"
      },
